flowchart LR

CLI["`Client`"]
CLI_N["`React · Postman
HttpOnly cookies + X-CSRF-Token
no bearer token, no localStorage`"]
CLI -.- CLI_N

LBC["`Cloud LB · L4/L7`"]
LBC_N["`ALB or NLB, one entry per region
health-checks each Traefik instance
spreads across availability zones
NOT deployed today: there is one node
this is the growth path, not the state`"]
LBC -.- LBC_N

TRF["`Traefik v3.3`"]
TRF_N["`edge + load balancer
:80 to :443 TLS · single entrypoint
X-Forwarded-For · dashboard :8080 off
discovers replicas from Docker labels
round-robin: request cost is uniform
NO sticky sessions: the API is stateless
GAP: no healthCheck wired to /ready`"]
TRF -.- TRF_N

TRF2["`Traefik instance 2`"]
TRF2_N["`same config, another AZ
Traefik stops being a single point`"]
TRF2 -.- TRF2_N

R1["`api container 1`"]
R1_N["`docker · uvicorn x N workers
stateless: no session, no local file
4 workers measured at 2.11x throughput`"]
R1 -.- R1_N
R2["`api container 2`"]
R3["`api container 3`"]
RN["`api container N`"]
RN_N["`adding one is a compose scale,
never a config edit
capacity: 0.13 req/s per user
1M users = 130k req/s = ~730 cores
= ~250 containers of 4 vCPU`"]
RN -.- RN_N

H1["`Node A · Docker host`"]
H1_N["`4 vCPU · runs api + worker containers`"]
H1 -.- H1_N
H2["`Node B · Docker host`"]
H2_N["`scaling out = more hosts, same image
nothing in the application changes`"]
H2 -.- H2_N

W1["`worker container 1`"]
W2["`worker container 2`"]
W2_N["`same image as the API
the queue distributes, not the LB
prefetch 1: a busy worker gets no backlog`"]
W2 -.- W2_N

PGB["`PgBouncer :6432`"]
PGB_N["`the opposite of the LB: it CONCENTRATES
thousands of client connections to 100-200
max_connections=100 is the first wall`"]
PGB -.- PGB_N

OUT2["`▶ continues in 2 · API`"]
OUT4["`▶ continues in 4 · ASYNC`"]
OUT5["`▶ continues in 5 · DATA`"]

CLI -->|"HTTPS"| TRF
LBC -.->|"future: across AZs"| TRF
LBC -.-> TRF2
TRF ==>|"round-robin"| R1
TRF ==>|"round-robin"| R2
TRF ==>|"round-robin"| R3
TRF -.->|"round-robin"| RN
R1 -.->|"runs on"| H1
R2 -.->|"runs on"| H1
R3 -.->|"runs on"| H2
RN -.->|"runs on"| H2
W1 -.->|"runs on"| H1
W2 -.->|"runs on"| H2
R1 ==> OUT2
W1 --> OUT4
R2 -->|"every replica funnels here"| PGB
PGB --> OUT5

